  "identity": {
    "playing_style": "Under Van Persie (2025/26) Feyenoord played an aggressive, front-foot 4-3-3 built around striker Ayase Ueda, who won the Eredivisie golden boot with 25 league goals; the side scored 70 but conceded 44 in 34 games, i.e. attack-heavy and defensively porous. Van Bronckhorst, appointed 17 June 2026 on a two-year deal, has started 2026/27 in a 4-3-3 (Ernst; Read, St. Juste, Watanabe/Kraaijeveld, Mármol; Vanhoutte, Valente, Zechiël; Hadj Moussa, Ueda, Diarra) - Ueda was then sold to Lille on deadline day, leaving Ferri/Tengstedt as the No. 9 options.",
